    },
    {
      "id": "claim_42259d5c5dcc4fad84eca5f1db71f52f",
      "statement": "CallbackRegistry.validate_monitor(specs, module, extra_callbacks=None) runs after resolve/build and before trainer construction. It is a no-op when no checkpoint spec is present or when the resolved CheckpointSpec.monitor_metric is None (the unmonitored fallback). Otherwise the monitor_metric must appear in the union of (a) every spec's logged_metrics (registry path), (b) module.logged_metrics (Module-declared path: val/mean_reward for GRPO, val/gen_pair_acc for reward), and (c) every extra_callbacks member's logged_metrics (the hand-appended path: LatentX0MAE's val/x0_mae). A monitor logged by nobody raises ValueError naming the available set so Lightning never errors mid-fit on an unlogged monitor.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/callbacks/registry.py#L114-L154",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:af95f5276d1be7a22b7e75a5b7011bdbe4161b0dcf37dda3ba850149d5855b7e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c4908082a8384d008a90d7f0a72064b1",
      "statement": "The built-in registry specs are TrainLossSpec (no knobs, frozenset({train/loss_epoch})), FIDSpec (num_synth / every_n_epochs / center_slices_ratio / cov_ridge knobs, frozenset({val/fid})), CheckpointSpec (monitor_metric / save_top_k / save_last / every_n_epochs / mode / filename knobs, monitor_metric read defensively for validation), and PairedFidelitySpec (subset_size / every_n_epochs / num_inference_steps / seed knobs, frozenset({val/psnr, val/ssim})) exposed from src/manifold/training/callbacks/__init__.py. CheckpointSpec.build implements the two-branch ModelCheckpoint construction: monitor_metric=None keeps save_top_k=1 plus last.ckpt at every_n_epochs (JiT production fallback), otherwise tracks monitor_metric top-k plus last.",
