    {
      "id": "claim_96a607092975448bb1a621cb39a03657",
      "statement": "TrainingSpine.run (src/manifold/training/core.py) is the single caller of the CallbackRegistry and owns the canonical callback merge order: start from per-shell default_names; apply the callback_cfg knob overrides; then either replace the list with callback_names_override (the --callbacks CLI flag) or keep the merged list; then apply forbidden_callbacks (force-removing any name with a rank_zero_info log); then check forbidden_monitors against the merged checkpoint monitor_metric and raise ValueError on match; then resolve(specs), build(callbacks), extend with extra_callbacks (LatentX0MAE for the supervised ControlNet val/x0_mae monitor), call validate_monitor, locate the ModelCheckpoint (raising ValueError with the resolved names if none survived the merge), build_trainer, and trainer.fit.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/core.py#L42-L162",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1dd42fd3ea9705af9c779b202fadfc2e98f98f7fb61f231634d6540dc59a9535:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_35e317ec11d74b11a5b5f144a11320f8",
      "statement": "forbidden_callbacks and forbidden_monitors are post-merge override-resistant guards: forbidden_callbacks force-removes named entries from the merged list (logging rank_zero_info) AFTER callback_names_override is applied, so a YAML callbacks: block or a --callbacks CLI flag cannot re-enable a forbidden callback; forbidden_monitors rejects a monitor_metric set in callback_cfg[checkpoint] BEFORE resolve. The GRPO ControlNet path passes forbidden_callbacks={\"fid\": \"constant frozen-base metric\"} and forbidden_monitors={\"val/fid\": ...} because Module.sample() ignores the trainable ControlNet, making an unconditional FID a constant frozen-base metric independent of the policy. The forbidden guards live generically in the spine and carry no GRPO-specific vocabulary.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/core.py#L108-L131",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:baa9a087d3738075b46be0830580e8b61797158d76daabfd0edccac6f3d2955a:"
        },
        {
