      "id": "claim_4f1b1dc0a2604fa5bcfeb29e17abe486",
      "statement": "TrainingSpine.run fails fast with ValueError('TrainingSpine.run: the resolved callback list has no ModelCheckpoint (names=...)') when an override drops the checkpoint entry, instead of letting next(...) raise StopIteration deeper in the call (codex #170 P2; tests/test_callback_registry.py::test_training_spine_fails_fast_without_checkpoint). A checkpoint callback is required by the run_* return contract.",
